          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "With this side quest nearing the finish line, I wanted to share screenshots from the original Figma file for the project. A lot of what I drafted early on is still here, and it is fun to look back at the small details I only realized would not work after I had already built them. I can only hope my career follows a similar arc: slow and steady, with room to enjoy the process."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Raising a glass to bigger and better things ahead."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
